abstract: >-
  A teaching book that explains C and C++ through the object model: the width,
  the lifetime and the owner of every object, from a single int to a PDB
  structure. The text and diagrams are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; the code in
  code/, labs/ and tools/ is MIT.
